      "message": "I am preparing it as part of b/183090215. The goal there is make it possible to use things like `sdk_version: \"module_30\"` in cc modules to get access to the `# apex` APIs.\n\nAnother side effect of this entire changes would be that we will be able to use `sdk_version: \"\u003ccodename\u003e\"` across cc and java, which currently is supported only for cc.",
      "parentUuid": "3a6ca17c_a0751f3b",
